  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "隧道工程",
    "sub_ename": "TUNNEL ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹隧道工程的初步概念；內容包括隧道工程演進、地質調查、設計與分析、施工方法、施工監測及遭遇困難簡介。本課程為大地技師第二階段考試科目之一。",
    "describe_eh": " This course introduces the preliminary concepts of tunnel engineering; the content includes tunnel engineering evolution, geological investigations, design and analysis, construction methods, construction monitoring and introduction to difficulties encountered. This course is one of the required courses of the second stage examination for geotechnical engineer.",
